{"id":"0761cc6d55d40d5e","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-circuit-computes-function.md","title":"Circuit Computation","display":"df-circuit-computes-function — Circuit Computation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-circuit-computes-function","aliases":["28-df-circuit-computes-function","Circuit Computes a Function"],"display":"df-circuit-computes-function — Circuit Computation","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definitions 6.1–6.2 and §6.7.1","source_printed_pages":"107–108,117","source_pdf_pages":"133–134,143","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-circuit-computes-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-circuit-computes-function</span><span>Circuit Computes a Function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-circuit-computes-function — Circuit Computation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definitions 6.1–6.2 and §6.7.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"107–108,117"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"133–134,143"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}\">\\(C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}\\)</span> (布尔电路, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}^m\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}^m\\)</span> (布尔函数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{out}_C\">\\(\\operatorname{out}_C\\)</span> (电路输出函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\equiv f\">\\(C\\equiv f\\)</span> (电路计算函数关系)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C\\equiv f\\leftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(\\operatorname{out}_C(x)=f(x))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C\\equiv f\\leftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(\\operatorname{out}_C(x)=f(x))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\equiv f\">\\(C\\equiv f\\)</span> 是精确计算，不含近似误差。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definitions 6.1–6.2 and §6.7.1，印刷页 107–108,117；PDF 页 133–134,143。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}$ (布尔电路, see [[28-df-boolean-circuit]])","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{out}_C$ (电路输出函数, see [[28-df-boolean-circuit]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{out}_C","display":false},{"tex":"C\\equiv f","display":false},{"tex":"C\\equiv f\\leftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(\\operatorname{out}_C(x)=f(x))","display":true},{"tex":"C\\equiv f","display":false}],"bytes":1273,"backlinks":[{"id":"4c85902878b27217","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal B_n=\\{f\\mid f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。$\\operatorname{tt}_n(f)\\in\\{0,1\\}^{2^n}$ 按字典序列出真值表。$P=(P_n)_{n\\ge1}$，$P_n:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\{0,1\\}$。$s:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\mathbb N$；$b\\in\\mathbb N$ 为规模阈值。\n$\\operatorname{BF}(C)$ 为有界扇入谓词，$\\operatorname{size}(C)$ 为非输入门数，$\\operatorname{out}_C(x)$ 为输出向量，see [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]、[[28-df-circuit-size]]、[[28-df-circuit-computes-function]]。$M(w)$ 与时间来自 [[28-df-machine-resources]]；判定输出是单比特串。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-92","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"布尔电路：[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]、[[28-df-circuit-computes-function]]、[[28-df-circuit-size]]、[[28-df-circuit-depth]]、[[28-df-formula-size]]。"}],"outgoing":["7776a98a623ada8d"]}